{"id":725,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Trying to pet Litten before it trusts you will result in a nasty scratch from its sharp claws. Be careful."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It spends even the smallest amount of downtime grooming its fur with its tongue. Loose fur gathers in its stomach and serves as fuel for fiery moves."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Its coat regrows twice a year. When the time comes, Litten sets its own body on fire and burns away the old fur."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"If you try too hard to get close to it, it won’t open up to you. Even if you do grow close, giving it too much affection is still a no-no."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It doesn’t allow its emotions to be easily seen. Earning its trust takes time. It prefers solitude."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"While grooming itself, it builds up fur inside its stomach. It sets the fur alight and spews fiery attacks, which change based on how it coughs."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Blaze","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Fire-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Intimidate","hidden":true,"description":"When the Pokémon enters a battle, it intimidates opposing Pokémon and makes them cower, lowering their Attack stats."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Red","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":725,"name":"Litten","condition":null,"children":[{"id":726,"name":"Torracat","condition":"Lv. 17","children":[{"id":727,"name":"Incineroar","condition":"Lv. 34","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,10],[1,45],[3,52],[6,122],[9,46],[12,154],[15,44],[18,24],[21,424],[24,184],[27,207],[30,53],[33,37],[36,394]],"machine":[512,34,339,242,38,283,203,263,126,424,519,83,488,53,394,257,270,141,417,200,315,182,156,46,184,421,214,164,241,14,36,269,915,851,885,369,261],"egg":[252,575,681],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv5-167","name":"Litten","set":"Temporal Forces","